			"notes": "Fixed client side Lily Pad placement.\n\nFixed the SoundSystem consistently failing to initialize when certain operating system and LWJGL2 combinations are used.\n\nFixed NotFine detection failing when it is embedded into Angelica.\n\nLAN port override now disables itself if Hodgepodge is installed.\n\nMade the leaf decay range fix less invasive so it does not conflict with an upcoming mod."
		},
